WEBVTT

01:33.940 --> 01:36.190
32nd Annual Himaraya Festival

01:36.190 --> 01:42.480
Reach to Heaven and Seize
the Future That Lies Beyond!!

01:52.400 --> 01:53.610
Yo, 3rd.

01:53.610 --> 01:55.410
Don't call me 3rd.

01:55.410 --> 01:57.380
Came to see how it held up?

01:58.010 --> 01:59.010
Of course not.

01:59.640 --> 02:03.430
You just made this from trash and scrap
you found around the school, right?

02:04.070 --> 02:06.650
It wasn't trash and scrap we collected.

02:06.650 --> 02:09.230
It was things that are extremely
important to this school.

02:13.780 --> 02:18.790
Glasses Club!

02:18.790 --> 02:20.790
32nd Annual Himaraya Culture Festival

02:20.790 --> 02:22.660
Glasses Hard Biscuits
300 yen

02:24.650 --> 02:26.750
Tet-chan Omelet Katsu Rice

02:24.670 --> 02:26.750
Welcome, welcome!

02:27.010 --> 02:29.170
Cheap, tasty, and fast!

02:29.170 --> 02:31.680
Tet-chan's trademark omelet katsu rice!

02:31.680 --> 02:33.750
Tet-san, two omelet katsu.

02:33.750 --> 02:38.640
Extra katsu, light on the sauce,
and hold the green peas, please!

02:38.640 --> 02:39.640
Sure!

02:39.640 --> 02:41.430
Hold it!

02:41.750 --> 02:45.470
That's not good, Mr. Hariu.
You're not getting enough vegetables.

02:46.050 --> 02:47.050
What's this?

02:47.050 --> 02:52.150
Sachie Special Boiled Spinach Cream Puff

02:47.530 --> 02:52.150
It's a boiled spinach cream puff.
It's quite popular.

02:52.900 --> 02:54.150
Well...

02:54.150 --> 02:56.270
I would prefer the omelet katsu rice.

02:58.740 --> 03:01.450
It's like last night's typhoon
never happened.

03:03.050 --> 03:06.480
"Reach to Heaven and Seize
the Future That Lies Beyond."

03:06.480 --> 03:09.870
Truly appropriate weather
for this year's theme!

03:10.440 --> 03:13.680
As for the Grand Cross Blizzard
Eternal SS Tower...

03:11.350 --> 03:20.140
Grand Cross
Blizzard Eternal
SS Tower

03:13.680 --> 03:17.710
Once we place the part we
created ourselves on top,

03:17.710 --> 03:20.140
it should turn out somewhat symbolic.

03:20.420 --> 03:23.790
All right, I'll have to find
Soma-kun so we can finish it up.

03:24.480 --> 03:26.370
Where is the Glasses Club's displa—

03:27.270 --> 03:28.720
Looks like it's over there.

03:28.720 --> 03:30.560
S-Stomach pain...

03:29.250 --> 03:30.560
Stomach
Pain

03:36.340 --> 03:38.360
Where are the X-Ray Glasses Mk. 41?!

03:38.790 --> 03:41.120
Don't worry. As long as we have these...

03:41.310 --> 03:42.330
Lenses?

03:42.330 --> 03:47.360
Ultra super high tech lenses capable of
focusing every available light particle!

03:47.590 --> 03:50.130
They're the cornerstone of this
attempt at X-Ray Glasses!

03:50.540 --> 03:53.420
We can do this. This time, we can do this.

03:53.840 --> 03:55.420
Yukiya-senpai...

03:55.420 --> 03:56.920
...is on fire!

03:58.840 --> 04:01.430
Leave the X-Ray Glasses to Yukiya!

04:01.430 --> 04:03.180
We'll handle this!

04:04.620 --> 04:06.430
Glasses Club Presents:

04:06.430 --> 04:08.100
Come, Glasses Wearers!

04:06.430 --> 04:09.460
"Come, Glasses Wearers!
Treasure Hunt Game."

04:09.460 --> 04:10.690
Time to start!

04:11.970 --> 04:12.980
Glasses!

04:12.980 --> 04:15.230
This is the Glasses Club's display!

04:15.240 --> 04:21.240
Would anyone like some glasses?

04:15.550 --> 04:18.640
"Come, Glasses Wearers!
Treasure Hunt Game"

04:18.640 --> 04:21.230
is a recreational activity that only
glasses wearers can participate in.

04:22.000 --> 04:24.780
You must find ten of Yukiya's
naptime wakey-eye stickers

04:22.000 --> 04:26.490
Take some glasses!

04:24.780 --> 04:26.490
hidden throughout the school.

04:26.900 --> 04:30.740
The first one to reach the finish line wins!

04:31.010 --> 04:35.220
But in order to obtain something,
something must be lost.

04:35.440 --> 04:38.130
And now, you will witness our determination!

04:38.130 --> 04:40.880
Take some glasses! Take them, please!

04:41.510 --> 04:43.010
President...

04:44.430 --> 04:49.760
The prize for the winner of "Come,
Glasses Wearers! Treasure Hunt Game" is...

04:49.760 --> 04:50.770
Himaraya 3rd Technical High School
Lunch Ticket

04:50.990 --> 04:55.020
...15,000 yen worth of school meal tickets!

04:55.020 --> 04:57.320
15,000 yen worth of meal tickets?

04:57.320 --> 04:58.240
No way.

04:58.240 --> 04:59.310
You gotta be kidding!

04:59.310 --> 05:00.440
That's a lifetime's worth!

05:00.440 --> 05:01.940
Glasses!

05:01.940 --> 05:03.070
Glasses, please!

05:08.110 --> 05:11.220
The age of glasses has just begun!

05:10.310 --> 05:12.160
Age of Glasses

05:12.160 --> 05:13.160
Glasses!

05:14.500 --> 05:16.080
Hand over the glasses!

05:24.190 --> 05:25.930
You did it, Akira.

05:27.530 --> 05:29.350
X-Ray

05:29.760 --> 05:30.980
They're gone!

05:30.980 --> 05:31.980
Glasses!

05:36.490 --> 05:38.640
It's not getting any better.

05:38.640 --> 05:41.970
All of your pent-up anxiety must have exploded.

05:41.970 --> 05:44.000
Just take a nice, long rest.

05:44.000 --> 05:45.600
But the tower...

05:46.030 --> 05:49.280
The student council has to
officiate the closing ceremony.

05:49.610 --> 05:51.980
Why don't we just complete it then?

05:54.780 --> 05:57.290
Yeah, that works.

06:02.670 --> 06:04.670
It's incredible!

06:04.670 --> 06:09.290
The dark school that used to be
almost empty of glasses wearers

06:09.290 --> 06:13.400
has been reborn into a
comfortable place full of them!

06:13.400 --> 06:16.800
Hayato, you're annoying.
But it is an amazing sight!

06:16.800 --> 06:18.690
Amazing, amazing!

06:20.210 --> 06:21.190
Akira!

06:21.190 --> 06:24.260
Look, Yukiya! This beautiful sight...

06:24.260 --> 06:27.200
The X-Ray Glasses Mk. 42
have gone missing!

06:27.200 --> 06:28.100
What?

06:28.100 --> 06:33.250
It appears someone mistook them for
treasure-hunting glasses and took them!

06:33.250 --> 06:34.190
What?!

06:34.190 --> 06:35.400
Let's find them!

06:35.400 --> 06:42.640
After all, they have "X-Ray Glasses Mk. 42"
engraved plainly on the temple.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.880
X-Ray Glasses Mk. 42

06:42.640 --> 06:43.880
We'll find them right away!

06:52.920 --> 06:53.970
Shock...

06:55.020 --> 06:58.800
Our paradise has suddenly
turned into an image of hell.

06:58.800 --> 07:01.270
They're all the same glasses, after all.

07:01.670 --> 07:04.270
They were almost finished, too...

07:04.270 --> 07:06.880
I-It's okay!

07:07.600 --> 07:12.660
If they're almost finished, then they
might be able to X-Ray even now.

07:10.200 --> 07:10.960
X-Ray

07:12.660 --> 07:16.030
That means whoever's wearing
the X-Ray Glasses Mk. 42

07:16.030 --> 07:19.430
should be able to find ten
wakey-eye stickers really easily.

07:19.430 --> 07:23.200
In other words, whoever finishes
the treasure hunt game first

07:23.200 --> 07:25.420
is probably wearing the
X-Ray Glasses Mk. 42!

07:25.710 --> 07:27.680
Mitsuki, you...

07:28.810 --> 07:33.760
Possibility unfolds infinitely for
glasses wearers who believe!

07:36.660 --> 07:40.180
...is the kind of thing
Soma-senpai might say.

07:43.170 --> 07:46.570
You've become a fine
glasses wearer indeed, Mitsuki.

07:51.280 --> 07:53.450
The finish line is the club room. Let's go!

07:53.450 --> 07:54.490
Yeah!

07:54.490 --> 07:55.500
Glasses!

08:04.200 --> 08:06.750
Part of the Glasses Club's display?

08:08.590 --> 08:11.350
Oh, someone's already here!

08:11.350 --> 08:12.310
That's...

08:12.410 --> 08:13.610
Hikaru!

08:14.510 --> 08:15.800
Akira-kun.

08:15.800 --> 08:16.810
Glasses.

08:17.080 --> 08:18.230
Here you are.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.640
Hikaru! You...

08:20.640 --> 08:21.730
Wait, Akira.

08:22.010 --> 08:24.570
Hikaru's aren't the X-Ray Glasses.

08:24.030 --> 08:25.440
Recreation Glasses

08:26.360 --> 08:28.730
Oh, you're right.

08:28.730 --> 08:31.670
It's impressive that you
found them this fast.

08:31.670 --> 08:37.760
A lot of people shared theirs with me.
I ended up with ten before I knew it.

08:37.760 --> 08:39.200
Really?

08:39.560 --> 08:43.710
Yeah. Your school is full of
really nice people, Akira-kun.

08:44.060 --> 08:48.060
Yeah! Especially now that it's
full of glasses wearers.

08:48.060 --> 08:50.740
There can be no better group of people!

08:51.980 --> 08:54.060
So I get the lunch tickets, right?

08:55.780 --> 08:59.470
That's my little brother. No mercy,
even against your own family.

08:59.470 --> 09:03.040
Of course not!
But now I can treat everyone!

09:04.750 --> 09:07.060
I guess I was wrong.

09:07.060 --> 09:10.690
Where could the X-Ray Glasses be, then?

09:07.380 --> 09:08.230
Here

09:11.240 --> 09:13.730
X-Ray Glasses
Mk. 42

09:14.410 --> 09:16.240
The Glasses Club, eh?

09:19.740 --> 09:21.890
Wh-What am I...

09:27.050 --> 09:28.900
<i>Official business announcement!</i>

09:28.900 --> 09:31.000
<i>Everybody in the student council,</i>

09:31.000 --> 09:33.740
<i>come on very quickly to
the student council room!</i>

09:35.970 --> 09:37.980
Cafeteria

09:35.970 --> 09:37.980
Let's eat!

09:46.440 --> 09:51.350
<i>We'll be holding the closing ceremony
for the 32nd Annual Hima Fest shortly.</i>

09:51.990 --> 09:56.480
<i>Please meet by the assembly
platform on the central grounds.</i>

09:57.760 --> 10:00.540
Everyone, thank you.

10:00.540 --> 10:04.690
The 32nd Annual Hima Fest
has ended in success.

10:04.690 --> 10:07.250
Ah... And here at the end,

10:08.200 --> 10:09.760
there's one thing left to do.

10:12.220 --> 10:14.590
There is a student I wish
to introduce to you all!

10:16.450 --> 10:19.140
The president of the Glasses Club,
Soma Akira-kun.

10:19.140 --> 10:20.140
What?!

10:23.890 --> 10:29.400
32nd Annual Himaraya Culture Festival

10:24.330 --> 10:26.240
The theme of this year's Hima Fest was

10:26.240 --> 10:29.400
"Reach to Heaven and Seize
the Future That Lies Beyond."

10:30.000 --> 10:32.900
But that theme is not
limited to today alone!

10:33.710 --> 10:38.160
When we reach out with our hands,
the future is what always lies just beyond.

10:39.190 --> 10:43.160
With that thought in mind,
we created this symbol of Hima High.

10:44.580 --> 10:46.670
That is what this Grand Cross—

10:48.340 --> 10:51.080
Are you people satisfied with just this?!

10:51.330 --> 10:55.090
As men, are you really
satisfied with just this?!

10:55.590 --> 10:59.250
U-Um, Soma-kun? What? What are you...

10:59.720 --> 11:00.770
Stomach pain...

11:00.770 --> 11:01.760
President!

11:01.760 --> 11:03.300
Are you okay?!

11:03.670 --> 11:05.070
Stop it, Soma!

11:05.070 --> 11:08.150
We were about to finish this
peacefully, and now you—

11:08.430 --> 11:10.980
Our culture festival is not over yet!

11:11.990 --> 11:16.550
Because we still haven't done something grand!

11:17.990 --> 11:19.280
Come on!

11:19.280 --> 11:22.180
The one grand thing that every man must do!

11:32.330 --> 11:36.840
Every man should raise
a banner in his home town!

11:37.100 --> 11:41.090
I don't think it's supposed to be a fish banner.

11:41.090 --> 11:44.010
They completely misunderstood
the meaning of that saying.

11:44.010 --> 11:46.600
Maybe I'm not a very good teacher?

11:47.550 --> 11:48.930
That's...

11:53.560 --> 11:57.900
Let's build it together!
The Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower!!

11:53.800 --> 11:56.020
Those signs pasted on the balloon...

11:56.500 --> 11:57.600
But why?

11:58.600 --> 12:01.520
Because they're full of your love!

12:06.550 --> 12:08.980
Soma-kun...

12:08.980 --> 12:11.450
There is no man who thinks
more of this school,

12:11.450 --> 12:13.460
no man who loves this
school more than you.

12:14.070 --> 12:17.630
One of the best things about Hima High
is that you're its student council president.

12:18.000 --> 12:21.380
In my opinion, you are this school's future!

12:41.230 --> 12:43.780
<i>It wasn't trash and scrap we collected.</i>

12:43.780 --> 12:47.030
<i>It was things that are extremely
important to this school.</i>

12:50.780 --> 12:53.040
Okay! Let's get it flying!

12:53.400 --> 12:54.500
Roger!

12:57.210 --> 12:59.590
That's a spherical solar panel, right?

12:59.590 --> 13:04.020
With that shape, just a little sunlight
should be enough to generate power.

13:04.620 --> 13:08.490
I don't get the complicated stuff,
but it sounds pretty smart.

13:08.490 --> 13:10.810
Maybe I'm a good teacher after all.

13:13.350 --> 13:15.350
The solar panel isn't coming out!

13:15.550 --> 13:16.800
Yukiya!

13:16.800 --> 13:17.900
It's no use!

13:17.900 --> 13:20.540
Is it because of the typhoon yesterday?

13:20.540 --> 13:21.990
What do we do?!

13:21.990 --> 13:24.630
If we can get the sunlight
to hit the panels...

13:24.630 --> 13:26.500
It's not possible!

13:26.500 --> 13:27.540
How come?

13:27.540 --> 13:30.240
Idiot! Because the sun is above it!

13:30.240 --> 13:33.590
What, after all that buildup,
it's not even working?

13:33.880 --> 13:35.240
Really got my hopes up there.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.240
Should've known.

13:36.240 --> 13:37.010
Lame.

13:37.250 --> 13:39.600
Well, that's life, I guess.

13:55.620 --> 13:57.080
Soma-senpai?!

13:57.080 --> 13:59.440
But your glasses are your life!

14:00.940 --> 14:03.460
I will get it flying!

14:04.420 --> 14:05.550
What's he doing?

14:05.550 --> 14:06.750
I get it!

14:06.750 --> 14:11.200
If we hit the solar panel with the
sunlight focused from our lenses...

14:13.890 --> 14:15.540
Senpai?! Mitsuki, too?!

14:17.890 --> 14:20.720
What should I do?

14:20.720 --> 14:22.250
Direct us!

14:25.510 --> 14:27.140
None of them can see.

14:27.140 --> 14:29.050
Vision Left/Right
0.03

14:27.330 --> 14:29.050
Where's the solar panel?!

14:30.090 --> 14:32.700
President, turn 10 degrees right.

14:32.700 --> 14:36.250
Minabe-senpai and Mitsuki, you rotate
45 degrees left and right respectively.

14:36.250 --> 14:39.230
Hachimine-senpai, raise yours
two cream puffs higher!

14:39.230 --> 14:40.520
Roger!

14:42.270 --> 14:43.660
It's not enough light!

14:45.330 --> 14:47.230
Hey, Glasses Club!

14:49.480 --> 14:51.080
The time has come!

14:51.080 --> 14:53.490
Focus the light on the base of the pot!

14:53.680 --> 14:55.840
Where did you get that enormous pot?

14:55.840 --> 14:58.520
Don't underestimate the
Hima High cafeteria!

14:59.330 --> 15:01.480
That sounds like Sachie-san!

15:01.480 --> 15:04.370
But isn't that school property?

15:04.370 --> 15:07.250
The principal's probably going to be mad.

15:08.060 --> 15:10.250
Well, it's your culture festival.

15:10.460 --> 15:13.270
We'll let you have your way this once.

15:25.020 --> 15:26.270
Still not enough...

15:26.790 --> 15:28.680
There's still not enough light!

15:28.680 --> 15:31.730
Are there no lenses that can focus more light?!

15:31.730 --> 15:33.330
The X-Ray Glasses.

15:33.890 --> 15:36.580
There are! The X-Ray Glasses' lenses!

15:36.810 --> 15:38.080
Then use them!

15:38.080 --> 15:41.670
But we don't know where
the X-Ray Glasses are!

15:41.670 --> 15:43.670
Dun-dunnn

15:44.210 --> 15:45.130
X-Ray Glasses
Mk. 42

15:45.380 --> 15:46.680
Those?!

15:50.800 --> 15:52.650
Hikaru! Hikaru!

15:52.650 --> 15:54.020
I'm right here, Akira-kun.

15:56.210 --> 15:58.300
Lend me your glasses.

15:58.300 --> 15:59.260
Of course!

15:59.780 --> 16:03.030
They were originally your glasses anyway.

16:05.520 --> 16:07.020
Can I use them?

16:10.650 --> 16:11.750
President?

16:11.750 --> 16:13.860
Hayato, take care of things here.

16:14.520 --> 16:15.710
Yes, sir!

16:21.110 --> 16:24.050
Everyone, lock on to the
bottom of the pot!

16:41.530 --> 16:42.810
The X-Ray Glasses!

16:46.140 --> 16:47.140
I'll go!

17:27.200 --> 17:29.280
It's the X-Ray Glasses' lenses!

17:29.510 --> 17:31.790
Higher! Higher!

17:31.790 --> 17:34.540
Shut up! Stop squirming, Soma!

17:47.530 --> 17:48.540
Well?

17:48.800 --> 17:50.540
Still not enough?

17:52.080 --> 17:53.550
A little more...

17:53.930 --> 17:56.060
We just need a little bit more light.

17:56.060 --> 17:57.260
Murmur...

18:03.040 --> 18:05.720
Hey, Glasses Club! Will these work?

18:08.370 --> 18:12.990
Y-Yeah. Just stay still and
keep reflecting the light.

18:12.990 --> 18:14.770
Stay still?

18:14.770 --> 18:16.980
This is a pretty tough pose to hold.

18:16.980 --> 18:20.240
But they've been holding it
the whole time.

18:20.240 --> 18:24.050
Jeez! I always knew Hima High
was full of idiots!

18:29.370 --> 18:32.250
So many people on our side...

18:32.810 --> 18:35.350
Doing something with your whole heart

18:35.350 --> 18:36.910
is really nice.

18:38.360 --> 18:41.890
Amazing! All these people are...

18:41.890 --> 18:43.940
You're amazing, President!

18:43.940 --> 18:49.520
The world is so much brighter
than I thought, Soma-senpai.

18:53.280 --> 18:54.570
Hold strong, Suzuki!

18:55.830 --> 18:57.830
Don't call me 3rd!

18:58.770 --> 18:59.870
Wait, what did you—

19:00.080 --> 19:01.580
I said, hold strong!

19:04.060 --> 19:06.570
You don't have to tell me!

19:07.080 --> 19:11.170
Go! Let our banner rise!

19:18.980 --> 19:20.180
It activated!

19:31.110 --> 19:32.110
We did it!

19:32.110 --> 19:33.370
It's flying!

19:52.740 --> 19:55.140
Everyone seemed to
have a lot of fun today.

19:55.140 --> 19:56.070
Yeah.

19:56.500 --> 19:59.840
Hey, what does Yukiya-kun's
smile look like?

19:59.840 --> 20:03.280
He never smiled much
when I could still see.

20:03.280 --> 20:05.860
It looks normal. Just like yours.

20:05.860 --> 20:08.600
Really? I smile properly?

20:14.600 --> 20:15.710
Hikaru...

20:15.710 --> 20:18.370
I'm sorry for breaking the X-Ray Glasses.

20:19.700 --> 20:21.370
But just leave it to me!

20:21.370 --> 20:24.360
Some day I'll make glasses
that can see so far...

20:24.360 --> 20:28.710
No, glasses that can see everything
in the whole world!

20:29.920 --> 20:32.960
I can't wait. Thank you, Akira-kun.

22:15.400 --> 22:17.650
Floooomp

22:17.970 --> 22:20.400
It looks like it'll be a bigger
clean-up job than we thought,

22:20.880 --> 22:24.910
but if all of the students work
together, we can handle it.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.920
Of course, president!

22:26.920 --> 22:30.910
If we band together like we did yesterday,
there's nothing we can't do!

22:31.110 --> 22:34.830
The weapon given only to the young.
Its name: youth.

22:34.830 --> 22:36.370
Good morning!

22:36.370 --> 22:38.930
Best friend everybody!

22:39.680 --> 22:40.790
Oh, this is...

22:40.790 --> 22:41.990
Maybe...

22:41.990 --> 22:43.750
They skipped out?!

22:43.750 --> 22:45.400
Stomach pain...

22:46.390 --> 22:49.390
Where did you go, Glasses Club?!

23:09.260 --> 23:10.540
Glasses!

23:15.180 --> 23:17.830
Tomorrow's horoscope for
all glasses wearers:

23:18.370 --> 23:21.180
No glasses, no life!
